  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "With their next move on the horizon, our vendors are motivated to sell, creating an exciting opportunity for you to secure this prized north-facing apartment in one of Takapuna’s most desirable and walkable beachside positions.\r\n\r\nImagine beginning your day simply stepping out for a stroll along Takapuna Beach, breakfast with friends, browsing the village boutiques or dining out without needing the car. \r\n\r\nThis is the freedom so many people aspire to, where a contemporary home, in one of the most walkable locations by the beach, allows everything you love about Takapuna to become part of your everyday life. \r\n\r\nPositioned on the quiet residential end, and sunny side of Huron Street, this beautifully presented, well-equipped apartment enjoys one of the much-admired Maison’s most sought-after positions. \r\n\r\nWith a generous 90sqm layout, the rare advantage of two secure basement parks, and a wide north-facing deck, this home offers apartment living without compromise, enjoying space, comfort and sunny, indoor-outdoor living, all year round.  \r\n\r\nLevel street and lift access, and secure entry further enhance the sense of ease.\r\n\r\nThe deck is a dedicated favourite space for so many reasons - a sunny space to enjoy your morning coffee, a quiet, sheltered place to relax, read or work from home in the fresh air, or the perfect setting for a glass of wine after a swim, dinner nearby, or your evening beach walk. \r\n\r\nZoned for Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls’ High School and Takapuna Grammar School, this location offers enduring appeal for those thinking ahead.\r\n\r\nThe best of Takapuna living is at your fingertips with more time for the things you love and less time spent maintaining what you don’t need.\r\n\r\nIf you'd love to live beachside, this Summer, call Shane or Jen now for your private viewing appointment.",
